  "headline": "Ravens trade for Pro Bowl centre Cam Jurgens",
  "summary": "ESPN reports that Baltimore has acquired Cam Jurgens from Philadelphia to address repeated injuries at centre. The Ravens send a 2027 fifth-round pick and a 2028 second-round pick, receiving Jurgens and a 2027 seventh-round pick. The two-time Pro Bowler is under contract through 2029 but remains in concussion protocol. Baltimore expects rookie Olaivavega Ioane to stay at centre against Atlanta until Jurgens is ready, then return to guard.",
